e by having a circle mate ride one until the Agatae just drops her mid-flight in a flight of fancy.<br /> <br /> Later on, he invents the parachute, but his prototype doesn't work and he just takes a bad fall in front of everyone. Switch to the dawn being catapulted through a demonic storm by Epitome using a siege ballista &quot;Don't worry, this is perfectly safe&quot; &quot;Oh gods WHY DID I TRUST <i>HIIIIIIM</i>?!?!&quot;.<br /> <br /> Still later in the trailer, Epitome dramatically warns the people of Khirigast that <i>a terrible curse</i> has befallen them. Mid-speech, he secretly signals his Circle-mates, who begin stealthily creating fake omens and mysterious supernatural displays to make the warning more credible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T23:39:37-08:00","id":1353498,"title":"","content":"Jalreth, Zenith Caste from Chiaroscuro. &quot;Everything has just been so dark and depressing lately. We need something with a bit of levity to happen, something we'll still be laughing about a few months from now.&quot;<br /> <br /> In the next scene her pet Tyrant Lizard, painted the most garish combination of fuchsia and neon green you can imagine is charging a horde of Wyld barbarians who break and start fleeing in absolute terror. She lets out a chuckle, &quot;That'll do.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avata