s charging a horde of Wyld barbarians who break and start fleeing in absolute terror. She lets out a chuckle, &amp;quot;That'll do.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I laughed. <br /> <br /> Smiling Tiger walks past the camera and shows off his sick tiger yakuza tattoo and then turns into a shadow, then leaps out of shadow an skewers a soldier in fancy armor with his multicolored tiger claws. He kills a few and tells the last one &quot;Feed me more Dynasts&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}